# Roäc is written on macOS and built on Windows both. Every text file is held
# LF in the index and LF in the working tree, so a Windows checkout does not
# report a change it has not made: without this, core.autocrlf rewrites the
# generated plugin registrants on every `flutter pub get` and git flags four
# files that differ from the index by nothing at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text. packs/roac-raven.zip is committed as the pack format's worked
# example, and a line-ending conversion would corrupt it.
*.zip binary
*.png binary
